## Errors & Mistakes
- 57a312f and f54c207 grew the PR to +388/-59 by adding prefill
  capacity_classes, shared helpers that refactored decode code, a
  test-only var for rolloutStartGracePeriod, applied update steps, and
  a mock rename. The user rejected that scope. Those changes were
  reverted here; do not reintroduce them in this PR.

## Attempts & Outcomes
- Applied update steps need rolloutStartGracePeriod (30 s) per step.
  Making it a var so a test could zero it worked but changed shared
  resource code for one test; plan-only steps (the #456 pattern) were
  restored. ToUpdateRequest_Fields already catches an update that
  drops Pd.

## Findings & Constraints
- The pinned buf.build/gen/go/coreweave/inference module
  (v1.36.12-20261008185853-22f8f31f8962.2) already has DeploymentPD,
  including DeploymentPDPoolAutoscaling.capacity_classes. It has no
  autoscaling claims field.
- terraform-plugin-testing v1.16.0 rejects PreApply plan checks on a
  PlanOnly step; PostApplyPreRefresh runs on that step's plan.
- provider.TestProtoV6ProviderFactories is a global map with no
  options, so tests cannot inject resource fields.

